4. Frontend Technology Stack

Recommend and implement a modern, maintainable stack based on actual project compatibility.

Preferred direction:

- React — component-based frontend.
- Vite — frontend development server and production build, if compatible.
- Tailwind CSS — responsive styling and theme implementation.
- Lucide React — consistent modern icons.
