6. UI Design Direction

Build a modern enterprise fintech Control Tower dashboard that is visually polished, information-rich, and easy to understand.

Use the reference screenshots for functional inspiration, but improve the visual quality and consistency.

Design requirements:

- Clean, compact application header.
- Clear page hierarchy and navigation.
- Colorful but professional KPI cards.
- Soft backgrounds and elevated white/near-white content cards.
- Rounded corners, subtle shadows, refined borders, and consistent spacing.
